{"assets":["/statement-assets/798de52ce844db88bfb31852d27c7f6caae57b0bee73804cb96e1b41e993bde0.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"696","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Legen..."}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"6 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Barney was hanging out with Nora for a while and now he thinks he may have feelings for her. Barney wants to send her a cheesy text message and wants to make her as happy as possible."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/798de52ce844db88bfb31852d27c7f6caae57b0bee73804cb96e1b41e993bde0.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially, happiness level of Nora is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":". Nora loves some pickup lines like \"I'm falling for you\" and stuff. Totally, she knows "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" pickup lines, each consisting only of lowercase English letters, also some of them may be equal (in writing, but different in pronouncing or meaning though). Every time Nora sees "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th pickup line as a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"consecutive subsequence"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of Barney's text message her happiness level increases by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":". These substrings may overlap, for example, Nora will see the pickup line "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" twice and the pickup line "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" once in text message "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Due to texting app limits, Barney's text may have up to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Barney asked you to help him make Nora as much happy as possible, it's gonna be legen..."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 200, 1 ≤ l ≤ 1014"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of pickup lines and the maximum length of Barney's text."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":"), meaning that Nora's happiness level increases by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" after every time seeing "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th pickup line."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the pickup lines. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them contains a single string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"si"},{"kind":"text","text":" consisting of only English lowercase letter. Summary length of all pickup lines does not exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"200"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"All strings are not empty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the only integer — the maximum possible value of Nora's happiness level after reading Barney's text."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 6\n3 2 1\nheart\nearth\nart\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 6\n3 2 8\nheart\nearth\nart\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"16\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An optimal answer for the first sample case is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"hearth"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" containing each pickup line exactly once."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An optimal answer for the second sample case is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"artart"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"696D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/696/problem/D"}